#: includes/class-admin.php:58
msgid "Our vehicle listings are provided by AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace Group AG). Vehicle photos are loaded directly from the AutoScout24 image server (images.autoscout24.ch); your browser therefore sends your IP address and browser information to that server. Links to vehicles lead to autoscout24.ch."
msgstr "Unsere Fahrzeuginserate stammen von AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace Group AG). Fahrzeugfotos werden direkt vom Bildserver von AutoScout24 (images.autoscout24.ch) geladen; Ihr Browser übermittelt dabei Ihre IP-Adresse und Browserinformationen an diesen Server. Links zu Fahrzeugen führen zu autoscout24.ch."

